==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Ultra Prism|Carnivine|12}} from the {{TCG|Ultra Prism}} expansion.
*'''Flog''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Legendary Treasures|Tangela|1}} and {{TCG ID|Legendary Treasures|Tangrowth|2}}, both from the {{TCG|Legendary Treasures}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Omega Ruby}}.

